#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Customers can start a subscription without filling in the standard checkout "
"form. The Recurring API creates the agreement, and Userinfo supplies "
"customer details with consent. Shipping is calculated in your store, not "
"selected in the Vipps/MobilePay app."
msgstr ""
"Kunder kan starte et abonnement uten å fylle ut det vanlige kasseskjemaet. "
"Recurring API oppretter avtalen, og Userinfo henter kundeopplysninger med "
"kundens samtykke. Frakt beregnes i nettbutikken og velges ikke i Vipps/"
"MobilePay-appen."

