msgstr "Utvalgte abonnementsprodukter"

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Product listings"
msgstr "Produktlister"

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Show subscription buttons in shop and category listings"
msgstr "Vis abonnementsknapper i butikk- og kategorilister"

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Uses the product selection above. Variable subscriptions require customers "
"to select options on the product page."
msgstr ""
"Bruker produktutvalget ovenfor. For variable abonnementer må kunden velge "
"alternativer på produktsiden."

