msgid ""
"Show the product button when recurring Express checkout is enabled for "
"selected products."
msgstr ""
"Vis produktknappen når hurtigkasse for abonnementer er aktivert for utvalgte "
"produkter."

#: recurring/includes/wc-vipps-recurring-express-checkout.php
msgid ""
"Express checkout for subscriptions is disabled. Please use the checkout page."
msgstr "Hurtigkasse for abonnementer er deaktivert. Bruk kassesiden."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Let customers start a subscription from a product page, the cart or checkout "
"using their details from Vipps/MobilePay."
msgstr ""
"La kunder starte et abonnement fra en produktside, handlekurven eller kassen "
"med opplysningene sine fra Vipps/MobilePay."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Important! Express checkout for subscriptions currently supports only static "
"shipping."
msgstr ""
"Viktig! Hurtigkasse for abonnementer støtter foreløpig bare statisk frakt."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Use fixed-price or free shipping. Customers cannot choose shipping in the "
"Vipps/MobilePay app."
msgstr ""
"Bruk fastpris eller gratis frakt. Kunden kan ikke velge frakt i Vipps/"
"MobilePay-appen."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Turning this off hides the buttons. Purchases already started can still "
"finish."
msgstr ""
"Når dette slås av, skjules knappene. Påbegynte kjøp kan fortsatt fullføres."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Uses the product selection above. Products with options must be opened "
"before purchase."
msgstr ""
"Bruker produktutvalget ovenfor. Produkter med valgmuligheter må åpnes før "
"kjøp."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"When turned off, customers buy only the selected product. Their other cart "
"items are kept for later."
msgstr ""
"Når dette er slått av, kjøper kunden bare det valgte produktet. Andre varer "
"i handlekurven beholdes til senere."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Ask customers to accept the terms before payment"
msgstr "Be kunden godta vilkårene før betaling"

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Set your terms and conditions page in WooCommerce settings."
msgstr "Velg vilkårssiden i innstillingene for WooCommerce."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Ask for an address even for purchases that do not need shipping"
msgstr "Be om adresse også ved kjøp som ikke krever frakt"

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "An address is always requested when shipping is needed."
msgstr "Det bes alltid om adresse når kjøpet krever frakt."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Abandoned purchases"
msgstr "Avbrutte kjøp"

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Clean up abandoned Express purchases"
msgstr "Rydd opp i avbrutte kjøp fra hurtigkassen"

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
