#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Move abandoned Checkout orders and orders with changed contents to the "
"trash. Checks run every hour."
msgstr ""
"Flytt forlatte Checkout-bestillinger og bestillinger med endret innhold til "
"papirkurven. Kontrollen kjøres hver time."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Find your Merchant Serial Number in the Vipps/MobilePay developer portal."
msgstr ""
"Finn ditt Merchant Serial Number i utviklerportalen til Vipps/MobilePay."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Add letters or numbers before each payment reference to keep references "
"unique across stores."
msgstr ""
"Legg til bokstaver eller tall foran hver betalingsreferanse for å holde "
"referansene unike på tvers av butikker."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"The order status when the first payment is reserved but not yet collected. "
"Renewal orders use the setting below."
msgstr ""
"Bestillingsstatusen når den første betalingen er reservert, men ennå ikke "
"trukket. Fornyelsesbestillinger bruker innstillingen under."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Renewal order status while awaiting payment"
msgstr "Status for fornyelsesbestillinger som venter på betaling"

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"The status for renewal orders while waiting for payment. Payment can take a "
"few days."
msgstr ""
"Statusen for fornyelsesbestillinger mens de venter på betaling. Betalingen "
"kan ta noen dager."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Automatically complete paid renewal orders"
msgstr "Fullfør betalte fornyelsesbestillinger automatisk"

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Set renewal orders to \"Completed\" when Vipps/MobilePay confirms payment."
msgstr ""
"Sett fornyelsesbestillinger til «Fullført» når Vipps/MobilePay bekrefter "
"betalingen."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Background checks"
msgstr "Bakgrunnskontroller"

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Check payment status in the background to keep orders up to date."
msgstr ""
"Kontroller betalingsstatus i bakgrunnen for å holde bestillingene oppdatert."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Payments per check"
msgstr "Betalinger per kontroll"

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"The number of payments to check at a time. Use 5 to 100. Higher values can "
"slow down your store."
msgstr ""
"Antall betalinger som kontrolleres om gangen. Bruk 5 til 100. Høyere verdier "
"kan gjøre butikken tregere."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Payment check order"
msgstr "Rekkefølge for betalingskontroll"

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Choose which payments to check first. Random suits most stores. Use Oldest "
"first if your subscriptions renew on the same date."
msgstr ""
"Velg hvilke betalinger som skal kontrolleres først. Tilfeldig passer for de "
"fleste butikker. Bruk Eldste først hvis abonnementene fornyes på samme dato."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Save messages to the WooCommerce logs to help with troubleshooting."
msgstr "Lagre meldinger i WooCommerce-loggene for å hjelpe med feilsøking."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Use the Vipps MobilePay test environment to try payments."
msgstr "Bruk testmiljøet til Vipps MobilePay for å prøve betalinger."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid "Test mode is controlled by WC_VIPPS_RECURRING_TEST_MODE."
msgstr "Testmodus styres av WC_VIPPS_RECURRING_TEST_MODE."

#: recurring/includes/admin/vipps-recurring-settings.php
msgid ""
"Replace the WooCommerce checkout with Vipps MobilePay Checkout. Customers "
"share their billing and shipping details from the app. "
"<br><br><strong>Important!</strong> Checkout for recurring payments "
"<strong>only supports static shipping</strong> at the moment."
msgstr ""
"Erstatt WooCommerce-kassen med Vipps MobilePay Checkout. Kundene deler "
"faktura- og leveringsopplysninger fra appen. <br><br><strong>Viktig!</"
"strong> Checkout for faste betalinger <strong>støtter kun statisk frakt</"
"strong> for øyeblikket."

